{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49425","headline":"临江仙 一 · 牛希济","name":"临江仙 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"峭碧参差十二峰，冷烟寒树重重。\n瑶姬宫殿是仙踪。\n金炉珠帐，香霭昼偏浓。\n一自楚王惊梦断，人间无路相逢。\n至今云雨带愁容。\n月斜江上，征櫂动晨钟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"牛希济","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49425.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49425","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}